  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Schiller International University (SIU), established in 1964, is a popular private institution offering a variety of undergraduate and postgraduate programs. The university emphasises practical, challenge-based learning, ensuring you're well-equipped to tackle real-world challenges.​ Plus, SIU is accredited in the United States by the Accrediting Commission of Career Schools and Colleges (ACCSC).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>​At Schiller International University, you become part of a global student community, with students from over 130 nationalities. SIU provides you with multiple student support services, such as Personal Advisors and wellness programs, along with various cultural and social events.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>SIU does not provide on-campus accommodation. However, you can explore options like private student housing or homestays near the campus.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>All SIU campuses have a library stocked with a variety of academic resources, including books, journals, and digital materials.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
